	(footprint "Tracker_Mechanical:Wing_Tab_4P"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "74d6364e-e55f-4f51-8c59-c39cbf9a0ff4")
		(at 5.2 35)
		(descr "Hub-side WING SOCKET land set for the v9 3D hub/wing assembly: FOUR wing interfaces, one per hub edge, at 90 deg spacing. Per interface: 4 copper lands on EACH outer face (F.Cu + B.Cu) = 8 lands per interface, land 4.0 x 1.2 mm, pitch 1.8 mm, pads 1..4 = SOLAR_P / GND / RF_FEED (v9 provision, NO NET) / SOLAR_N. Cited: docs/adr/046-wing-board-interface.md s2.1/s2.2/s4.1 (4-pin tab, land 4.0x1.2 mm, 1.8 mm pitch, insert depth 6.0 mm, hub slot 0.9 mm +/-0.10 mm, 90 deg attach) and docs/WING-TO-HUB-SOCKET-SPEC.md s2/s4/s6 (4 lands per face, 8 per interface, edge clearance, keep-outs, silkscreen). docs/adr/048-v9-hub-wing-interfaces.md records which numbers are cited vs newly decided. NOT human-accepted: ADR-046 and ADR-048 are Status Proposed.")
